<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page { size: 820px 1060px; margin: 0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif;
    margin: 0; color: #3a332c;
  }
  .page {
    width: 820px; height: 1060px; padding: 70px 65px;
    page-break-after: always; position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: avoid; }

  /* 표지 */
  .cover { background: #24211d; color: #efe9df; }
  .cover .brand { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #b9ab92; }
  .cover .kicker { margin-top: 220px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #c9a86a; }
  .cover .rule { width: 60px; height: 3px; background: #c9a86a; margin: 18px 0 26px; }
  .cover h1 { font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.35; margin: 0 0 30px; font-weight: 700; }
  .cover .name { font-size: 18px; color: #d8cdbd; margin-bottom: 34px; }
  .cover ol { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .cover li { display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #d8cdbd; }
  .cover li .n { color: #c9a86a; font-weight: 700; }
  .cover .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 60px; left: 65px; right: 65px;
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; color: #a89a82; border-top: 1px solid #46403a; padding-top: 18px; }
  .cover .footer .label { color: #7c7062; display:block; margin-bottom:4px;}

  /* 공통 */
  .kicker2 { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #a97142; font-weight: 700; }
  h2.title { font-size: 27px; margin: 10px 0 18px; }
  .rule2 { width: 46px; height: 3px; background: #a97142; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .lead { color: #6b6155; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 26px; line-height:1.6;}
  .card { background: #fbf7f0; border: 1px solid #ecdfc9; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px 24px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .card p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; margin: 0; }
  .tag { color: #a08a63; font-size: 12.5px; margin-bottom: 6px; }

  body .body-bg { background: #f7f2ea; }

  /* 개요 페이지 */
  .overview-grid { display: flex; gap: 26px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .overview-grid .chart { width: 300px; text-align: center; }
  .overview-grid .scores { flex: 1; }
  .score-row { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .score-row .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
  .bar-bg { background: #e9e0d0; height: 7px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 5px 0; }
  .bar-fg { background: #a97142; height: 7px; border-radius: 4px; }

  /* 손금선 페이지 */
  .line-block { display: flex; gap: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .line-block img { width: 230px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e6dcc9; }
  .line-block .content { flex: 1; }
  .line-block h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 20px; }
  .conf { font-size: 11.5px; background: #efe4cf; color: #8a6d3b; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: 8px; }
  .tags { font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a7d68; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .obs { font-size: 13px; color: #6b6155; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .interp { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .tip { border-left: 3px solid #a97142; padding-left: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #6b5c42; }

  /* 타임라인 */
  .tl-item { display: flex; gap: 20px; padding: 16px 0; border-top: 1px solid #ecdfc9; }
  .tl-item:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .tl-age { width: 110px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #a97142; }
  .tl-body h4 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 16px; }
  .tl-body p { margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b433a; }

  /* 강점/살펴볼 점 */
  .two-col { display: flex; gap: 24px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .two-col .col { flex: 1; }
  .two-col h4 { font-size: 14px; border-bottom: 2px solid #24211d; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .item { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .item .t { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .item .d { font-size: 12.5px; color: #5c5346; line-height: 1.6; }

  /* 액션 플랜 */
  .action-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ecdfc9; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 22px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; background: #24211d; color: #efe9df; font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .action-item h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 15.5px; }
  .action-item p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; color: #4b433a; }
  .closing { background: #24211d; color: #d8cdbd; border-radius: 10px; padding: 26px 28px; margin-top: 22px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .closing .sign { margin-top: 14px; color: #a89a82; font-size: 12px; }

  .appendix-item { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .appendix-item .bar { width: 3px; background: #a97142; border-radius: 2px; }
  .appendix-item h4 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 15px; }
  .appendix-item p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; color: #4b433a; }
  .disclaimer-box { background: #efe9df; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 18px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b6155; margin-top: 10px; }

  /* 마스코트 / 말풍선 */
  .mascot-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 14px; margin: 14px 0; }
  .mascot-row img.mascot-sm { width: 62px; height: auto; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .bubble {
    position: relative; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #24211d;
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55;
    color: #24211d; max-width: 620px;
  }
  .bubble::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; left: -11px; bottom: 14px;
    border: 8px solid transparent; border-right-color: #24211d;
  }
  .bubble::after {
    content: ""; position: absolute; left: -8px; bottom: 15px;
    border: 7px solid transparent; border-right-color: #fff;
  }

  /* 코믹 요약 페이지 */
  .comic-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .comic-panel {
    background: #fff; border: 3px solid #24211d; border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px 18px 18px; text-align: center; position: relative;
  }
  .comic-panel .num {
    position: absolute; top: -14px; left: 16px; background: #a97142; color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .comic-panel img.mascot-lg { width: 120px; height: auto; margin: 6px auto 12px; display: block; }
  .comic-panel .bubble2 {
    background: #f7f2ea; border: 2px solid #24211d; border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: left;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- 1. 표지 -->
<div class="page cover">
  <div class="brand">손 금 연 구 소 &nbsp; 해 나 &nbsp; (프로토타입 데모)</div>
  <div class="kicker">손 금 정 밀 리 포 트</div>
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <h1>{{ narrative.cover.title }}</h1>
  <div class="name">{{ customer.name }} 님</div>
  <ol>
    {% for b in narrative.cover.bullets %}
    <li><span class="n">0{{ loop.index }}</span><span>{{ b }}</span></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <div class="footer">
    <div><span class="label">REPORT NO.</span>DEMO-{{ report_no }}</div>
    <div><span class="label">발행일</span>{{ issue_date }}</div>
    <div><span class="label">등급</span>프로토타입</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 2. 코믹 요약 (마스코트) -->
<div class="page body-bg">
  <div class="kicker2">COMIC SUMMARY</div>
  <h2 class="title">해나 도사가 먼저 훑어봤어요</h2>
  <div class="rule2"></div>
  <div class="lead">본격적인 리포트에 앞서, 이번 손금에서 눈에 띈 부분을 캐릭터가 먼저 짚어드립니다.</div>
  <div class="comic-grid">
    {% for c in narrative.comic %}
    <div class="comic-panel">
      <div class="num">CUT {{ loop.index }}</div>
      <img class="mascot-lg" src="file://{{ mascot[c.mascot] }}">
      <div class="bubble2">{{ c.text }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 3. 개요 -->
<div class="page body-bg">
  <div class="kicker2">OVERVIEW</div>
  <h2 class="title">당신의 손을 한눈에</h2>
  <div class="rule2"></div>
  <div class="lead">아래 지표는 손금의 형태에서 읽어낸 상대적인 경향입니다. 우열을 가리는 점수가 아닙니다.</div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="tag">{{ features.hand_shape.type_desc }}</div>
    <p><b>{{ features.hand_shape.type }}</b> &mdash; {{ narrative.overview_paragraph }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="overview-grid">
    <div class="chart"><img src="data:image/png;base64,{{ radar_png }}" width="300"></div>
    <div class="scores">
      {% for k, v in features.scores.items() %}
      <div class="score-row">
        <div class="top"><span>{{ k }}</span><span>{{ v }}</span></div>
        <div class="bar-bg"><div class="bar-fg" style="width:{{ v }}%"></div></div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 3. 3대 주선 -->
<div class="page body-bg">
  <div class="kicker2">MAJOR LINES</div>
  <h2 class="title">3대 주선</h2>
  <div class="rule2"></div>

  {% for key in ["life", "head"] %}
  {% set L = narrative.lines[key] %}
  <div class="line-block">
    <img src="file://{{ sample_image }}">
    <div class="content">
      <h3>{{ L.title }} <span class="conf">{{ L.confidence_label }}</span></h3>
      <div class="tags">{{ L.tags }}</div>
      <div class="obs">관찰 &middot; {{ L.observation }}</div>
      <div class="interp">{{ L.interpretation }}</div>
      <div class="tip">{{ L.action_tip }}</div>
      {% if L.mascot_note %}
      <div class="mascot-row"><img class="mascot-sm" src="file://{{ mascot.thinking }}"><div class="bubble">{{ L.mascot_note }}</div></div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="page body-bg">
  <div class="kicker2">MAJOR LINES &middot; 계속</div>
  <h2 class="title">감정선</h2>
  <div class="rule2"></div>
  {% set L = narrative.lines.heart %}
  <div class="line-block">
    <img src="file://{{ sample_image }}">
    <div class="content">
      <h3>{{ L.title }} <span class="conf">{{ L.confidence_label }}</span></h3>
      <div class="tags">{{ L.tags }}</div>
      <div class="obs">관찰 &middot; {{ L.observation }}</div>
      <div class="interp">{{ L.interpretation }}</div>
      <div class="tip">{{ L.action_tip }}</div>
      {% if L.mascot_note %}
      <div class="mascot-row"><img class="mascot-sm" src="file://{{ mascot.thinking }}"><div class="bubble">{{ L.mascot_note }}</div></div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="title" style="margin-top:36px;">부선</h2>
  <div class="rule2"></div>
  {% for key, L in narrative.minor_lines.items() %}
  <div class="card">
    <div class="tag">{{ L.tags }}</div>
    <p><b>{{ L.title }}</b> &mdash; {{ L.text }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<!-- 4. 타임라인 -->
<div class="page body-bg">
  <div class="kicker2">TIMELINE</div>
  <h2 class="title">시기별 흐름</h2>
  <div class="rule2"></div>
  <div class="lead">생명선을 손목 방향으로 따라가며 나이를 배분하는 유년법으로 읽었습니다. 정해진 운명이 아니라 흐름의 결입니다.</div>
  {% for t in narrative.timeline %}
  <div class="tl-item">
    <div class="tl-age">{{ t.age_range }}</div>
    <div class="tl-body"><h4>{{ t.label }}</h4><p>{{ t.text }}</p></div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<!-- 5. 특징 + 강점/살펴볼 점 -->
<div class="page body-bg">
  <div class="kicker2">DISTINCTIVE</div>
  <h2 class="title">당신 손에만 있는 것</h2>
  <div class="rule2"></div>
  {% if narrative.mascot_distinctive %}
  <div class="mascot-row"><img class="mascot-sm" src="file://{{ mascot.wow }}"><div class="bubble">{{ narrative.mascot_distinctive }}</div></div>
  {% endif %}
  {% for d in narrative.distinctive %}
  <div class="card"><div class="tag">{{ d.title }}</div><p>{{ d.text }}</p></div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="two-col">
    <div class="col">
      <h4>강점</h4>
      {% for s in narrative.strengths %}
      <div class="item"><div class="t">{{ s.title }}</div><div class="d">{{ s.text }}</div></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="col">
      <h4>살펴볼 점</h4>
      {% for s in narrative.watchpoints %}
      <div class="item"><div class="t">{{ s.title }}</div><div class="d">{{ s.text }}</div></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 6. 액션 플랜 -->
<div class="page body-bg">
  <div class="kicker2">ACTION</div>
  <h2 class="title">앞으로 세 달</h2>
  <div class="rule2"></div>
  {% for a in narrative.action_plan %}
  <div class="action-item">
    <span class="badge">{{ a.badge }}</span>
    <h4>{{ a.title }}</h4>
    <p>{{ a.text }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
  {% if narrative.mascot_action %}
  <div class="mascot-row"><img class="mascot-sm" src="file://{{ mascot.cheer }}"><div class="bubble">{{ narrative.mascot_action }}</div></div>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="closing">
    {{ narrative.closing }}
    <div class="sign">&mdash; 손금연구소 해나 (프로토타입 데모 출력)</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 7. 부록 -->
<div class="page body-bg">
  <div class="kicker2">APPENDIX</div>
  <h2 class="title">읽으실 때 주의할 점</h2>
  <div class="rule2"></div>
  <div class="appendix-item"><div class="bar"></div><div><h4>정해진 미래를 알려드리는 문서가 아닙니다</h4><p>손금은 과학적으로 검증된 예측 체계가 아닙니다. 관찰된 형태에 전통적 해석의 언어를 붙여 다른 각도에서 비춰보는 자료입니다.</p></div></div>
  <div class="appendix-item"><div class="bar"></div><div><h4>건강/법률/재무 판단으로 쓰지 마세요</h4><p>해당 분야 전문가와 상의하시기 바랍니다.</p></div></div>
  <div class="disclaimer-box">본 문서는 데모용 프로토타입 출력물이며, 실제 고객 사진이 아닌 프로그램으로 생성한 예시 이미지를 사용했습니다.</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
